  "description": {
   "value": "<p><strong>Cost:</strong> 250eb (Expensive)<br>\n<strong>Type:</strong> Armor Attachment (Body Armor, SP 13 or lower)<br>\n<strong>Attachment slots:</strong> 0</p>\n<p>Works only while the armor has at least 1 SP. Negates the Bonus Damage of Broken Arm, Torn Muscle, and Crushed Fingers from Brawling, Martial Arts, or Melee attacks and Special Moves. Options in the arms underneath (cyber or meat) can't be used while it's worn. Can't be concealed, though most people won't recognize it.</p>\n<p><strong>Foundry notes:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Armor Enhancement rules: one Enhancement per piece of armor (armor worn on both body and head counts as one piece); not for cyberware armor (Skinweave, Subdermal Armor) or armor that's part of an ACPA or vehicle; SP limits use the armor's fully repaired SP; a Tech installs or removes one in 1 hour with no check; they don't count as Tech Upgrades for Upgrade Expertise. Armor Attachments have no limit per armor unless stated.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><em>From <a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/13EnSAoiLDsC7zmL-Jr1RqIh_EnuVuFnExqiipDVquMk/edit\">Corgo's 77 Collection V3</a> by Corgopolis (Armor &amp; Fashion &gt; Armor Enhancements &amp; Kits).</em></p>"
